{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>1989年開拍電影《賭聖》掀起周星馳演藝高峰，一舉將周星馳推上「喜劇之王」寶座。當年負責執導的劉鎮偉極力推薦另一位「新晉導演」執導，雙方卻在最後關頭因為幾萬元片酬陷入僵局。這份對小數目金錢上寸步不讓，最終令當事人徹底錯失締造4,100萬港元票房奇蹟大好機會。[caption id='attachment_3547557' align='alignnone' ...</p>\n<p>1989年開拍電影《賭聖》掀起周星馳演藝高峰，一舉將周星馳推上「喜劇之王」寶座。當年負責執導的劉鎮偉極力推薦另一位「新晉導演」執導，雙方卻在最後關頭因為幾萬元片酬陷入僵局。這份對小數目金錢上寸步不讓，最終令當事人徹底錯失締造4,100萬港元票房奇蹟大好機會。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294494143004_19856757336b0162d16dcba.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294494143004_19856757336b0162d16dcba.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>劉鎮偉賞識TVB導演李力持，本來一開始希望《他來自江湖》鐵三角合作，卻因極少數目告吹。（圖片來源：資料圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>劉鎮偉力薦李力持執導《賭聖》卻遇上阻滯</h2>\n<p>當年王晶執導《賭神》大受歡迎並掀起全港賭片熱潮，思遠影業老闆吳思遠隨即萌生開拍同類喜劇念頭。劉鎮偉與元奎參與商討時忽發奇想，提議將內地興起特異功能元素融入其中，並極力推薦剛剛在電視圈嶄露頭角周星馳擔任男主角。由於劉鎮偉與元奎當時正忙於趕拍另一部電影而分身乏術，劉鎮偉便向吳思遠大力推薦曾執導《他來自江湖》並略見潛力李力持出任導演，深信他與周星馳能夠擦出強烈火花，未料劇組與李力持洽談合作條件時竟在幾萬元片酬上互不相讓。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294641182624_20528382936b0162d2cbd72.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-3\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294641182624_20528382936b0162d2cbd72.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>劉鎮偉接受文雋的YouTube頻道訪問，透露了不少獨家資訊。（圖片來源：《文雋講呢啲講嗰啲》）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>吳思遠親自拍板決定棄用李力持</h2>\n<p>面對片酬談判陷入膠著狀態，劉鎮偉坦言當時那個金錢差距極小，他回憶指出：「佢就係堅持多嗰少到呢……我真係覺得我轉頭俾咗你都仲得，你做乜仲要討價還價，仲要同會長。」吳思遠對此舉感到十分不滿，認為對方為少許金錢如此堅持，就算成功捧紅將來亦不懂感恩。吳思遠拋下一句「捧咗都冇用」後當機立斷決定換人，直接要求劉鎮偉與元奎親自上陣執導這部重頭戲。</p>\n<h2>李力持錯失良機後執導《情聖》票房遇冷</h2>\n<p>《賭聖》上映後票房狂收4,100萬港元並打破當時香港開埠紀錄，劉鎮偉因此分得一筆遠超導演片酬豐厚利潤。相比之下，李力持錯過這次黃金機會後，在隨後一年執導由周星馳主演電影《情聖》，最終票房僅收約1,655萬港元，成績與《賭聖》相距甚遠。不過這次風波並未有阻礙李力持與周星馳後續發展，兩人後來依然合作無間，共同打造出《唐伯虎點秋香》及《食神》等多部經典代表作。</p>\n<h2>網民熱烈討論周星馳經典神作換角內幕</h2>\n<p>劉鎮偉首度公開這段換角秘辛後，隨即在各大網上討論區引發熱烈迴響。大批網民對這段電影圈往事感到驚訝，有影迷留言表示：「為咗幾萬蚊錯失四千萬神作真係因小失大」、「如果當年係李力持拍，可能出唔到而家呢個經典效果」。部分觀眾從職場角度分析事件，直指吳思遠換人決定相當果斷，有網民評論：「老闆最忌員工未見功績就先掛住討價還價」、「機會從來都係留畀識得感恩同埋顧全大局員工」。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294806787098_8343278546b0162d47f6f8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294806787098_8343278546b0162d47f6f8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294978360805_16326294676b0162d632792.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294978360805_16326294676b0162d632792.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525295150025293_18198609416b0162d7e5414.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525295150025293_18198609416b0162d7e5414.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294494143004_19856757336b0162d16dcba.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294494143004_19856757336b0162d16dcba.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294641182624_20528382936b0162d2cbd72.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525294641182624_20528382936b0162d2cbd72.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17952529529179630_15213681136b0162d965118.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17952529529179630_15213681136b0162d965118.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525295444996146_14613468316b0162dac1927.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525295444996146_14613468316b0162dac1927.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525295607731055_16324565596b0162dc74d16.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179525295607731055_16324565596b0162dc74d16.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:43:55.413798+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1506,"images":10,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:22:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:37:26.220276+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:37:26.220276+00:00","content_hash":"ae75a4d1b965dafd28096a41eeea8d249b1372ebe69462a87629becb735f2c24","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}